$DATUM To a solution of this alcohol in 30 mL of dichloromethane were added
diacetoxy iodobenzene (450 mg, 1.4 mmol) and 15 mg of TEMPO. The
resulting slurry turned clear. After 16 h at RT, the mixture was washed
with sodium sulfite solution and extracted twice with 30% isopropanol in
chloroform (100 mL).
