$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (1'R,5R)-5-[1'-(tert-butyldiphenylsilyloxy)-2'-oxoethyl]-3H,5H-furan-2-one.
To a solution of alcohol 11 (456 mg, 1.19 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (50 mL) were
added BAIB (439 mg, 1.36 mmol) and a catalytic amount of 4-hydroxyTEMPO.
The mixture was stirred at r.t. for 6 h. After this time, the solvent was
removed; the residue obtained was dissolved in tBuOMe (50 mL). The
resulting solution was washed with 15% aqueous Na2S2O3 (3×30 mL) and sat.
aq. NaHCO3 (3×30 mL). The organic phase was dried and the solvent was
evaporated under reduced pressure then brown residue was obtained.
aldehyde 12. Yield: 451 mg (99%); brown iol. Rf=0.27 (30% EtOAc/Hexane);
[α]D24-42 (c 1, CHCl3). IR (NaCl): υ (cm-1) = 2929, 1694. 1H-NMR (CDCl3,
400 MHz) δ = 9.60 (s, 1H, H-2'); 7.70 (m, 4H, Ph); 7.49 (m, 6H, Ph); 4.80
(t, 1H, J=5.5Hz, H-5); 4.15 (m, 1H, H-1'); 2.58 (m, 2H, H-3); 2.20 (m,
2H, H-4); 1.19 (s, 9H, CH3-tBu). 13C-NMR (CDCl3, 100 MHz) δ = 201.9
(C-2'); 176.6 (C-2); 135.8 (CH-Ph); 132.1 (C-Ph); 130.7 (CH-Ph); 128.2
(CH-Ph); 80.3 (CH-1'); 79.6 (CH-5); 28.0 (CH2-3); 27.0 (CH3-tBu); 23.3
(CH2-4); 19.6 (C-tBu). EM (ESI+) [m/z, (%)]: 405 ([M-Na]+, 100); 305
([M-Ph]+, 7); 201 (47); 406 (30). HRSM (ESI+): calcd for C22H26NaO4Si,
405.14926; found, 405.14851.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of (-)-muricatacin from tri-O-acetyl-D-glucal
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Gonzalez, Maria; Gandara, Zoila; Pazos, Gonzalo; Gomez, Generosa; Fall,
Yagamare
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2013), 45(5), 625-632

