(6aR*,11aS*,11bR*)-11a-Methyloctahydro-1H-cyclohepta[α]indolizine-4,11(11aH,11bH)-dione
(34) and (35) Reoxidation: A mixture of alcohol S-9 (164 mg, 0.691 mmol),
1-Me-AZADO 4 (24.0 mg, 0.138 mmol), and BAIB (668 mg, 2.07 mmol) in
CH2Cl2 (5 mL) was stirred for 9 h at 40 °C. After being cooled to rt,
Na2SO3 (172 mg, 1.38 mmol) and water were added, then the resultant
solution was extracted with Et2O. The extracts were washed with brine,
then dried over MgSO4, and concentrated under reduced pressure. The crude
mixture was purified by flash silica gel column chromatography
(AcOEt:MeOH, 100:0 to 100:5) to give ketone 34 (159 mg, 98%) as a white
solid. 34 (major lactam):white solid. M.p. = 120-125 °C ; IR (neat) :
2942, 1693, 1634, 1444, 1415, 1392, 1309, 1240, 1173, 1095, 933, 918 cm-1
; 1H-NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ : 4.05 (1H, dd, J = 12.8, 9.2 Hz), 3.53 (1H,
dd, J = 12.8, 10.9 Hz), 3.41 (1H, dd, J = 11.8, 3.9 Hz), 2.51-2.35 (3H,
m), 2.27 (1H, ddd, J = 17.9, 12.3, 6.8 Hz), 2.14 (1H, ddd, J = 13.3,
11.1, 2.7 Hz), 2.05-1.48 (8H, m), 1.26 (1H, m), 1.20 (3H, s), 1.07 (1H,
dtd, J = 11.8, 13.3, 2.9 Hz) ; 13C-NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 213.1, 168.8,
68.0, 60.5, 45.6, 43.4, 42.1, 31.2, 25.8, 25.5, 24.5, 22.7, 21.5, 21.0 ;
MS m/z : 235 (M+), 220 (100%) ; HRMS calad. for C14H21NO2 (M+) :
235.1572, found : 235.1566.
