$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Aldehyde carbonate (-)-89: To a stirred solution of hydroxy carbonate
(-)-88-3 (180 mg, 0.182 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (5 mL) at 25°C were added
PhI(OAc)2 (3.0 equiv, 0.18 g, 0.55 mmol) and TEMPO (1.0 equiv, 28 mg,
0.182 mmol). The resulting mixture was stirred at that temperature for 24
h and then quenched with saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution (10 mL). The
resulting mixture was extracted with Et2O (2 × 20 mL), dried (MgSO4), and
concentrated in vacuo. The crude residue was purified by flash column
chromatography (silica, Et2O/hexanes, 10 → 40%) to furnish aldehyde
carbonate (-)-89 (175 mg, 0.178 mmol, 98%) as a white foam. compound
(-)-89, yield (175 mg, 0.178 mmol, 98%) Rf = 0.70 (silica, Et2O:hexanes,
1:1); [α]25 D = -44.76 (c = 2.1, CHCl3); IR (film): νmax = 2953s, 2881s,
1746s, 1716m, 1441w, 1374m, 1267m, 1195m, 1039s cm-1; 1H NMR (C6D6, 500
MHz): δ = 9.95 (s, 1 H), 7.36 (m, 4 H), 7.19 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H), 7.17
(t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H), 7.09 - 7.05 (m, 2 H), 6.03 (s, 1 H), 5.76 (s, 1 H),
4.98 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.82 (s, 1 H), 4.81 (s, 1 H), 4.76 (s, 1 H),
4.68 (d, J = 11.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.63 (s, 1 H), 4.61 (d, J = 11.5 Hz, 1 H),
4.57 - 4.49 (m, 3 H), 4.46 (s, 1 H), 4.41 (d, J = 6.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.16 (t,
J = 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.00 (d, J = 11.0 Hz, 1 H), 3.94 (d, J = 11.0 Hz, 1 H),
3.90 (m, 1 H), 3.39 (s, 3 H), 3.34 (m, 1 H), 2.90 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 1 H),
2.73 (ddd, J = 14.5, 9.5, 5.0 Hz, 1 H), 2.61 (m, 1 H), 2.54 (m, 1 H),
2.49 (d, J = 3.5 Hz, 1 H), 2.43 (t, J = 12.5 Hz, 1 H), 2.26 (m, 2 H),
2.20 - 1.70 (m, 11 H), 1.68 (s, 3 H), 1.54 (dd, J = 17.0, 12.6 Hz, 1 H),
1.40 (s, 3 H), 1.40 (m, 1 H), 1.37 (s, 3 H), 1.13 (s, 3 H), 1.07 (m, 1
H), 0.98 (s, 3 H), 0.07 (s, 3 H) ppm; 13C NMR (C6D6, 125 MHz): δ =
199.04, 155.35, 148.19, 144.24, 138.74, 138.49, 128.73, 128.62, 128.29,
128.19, 127.80, 127.75, 125.42, 111.85, 97.42, 96.82, 95.66, 94.83,
83.32, 82.46, 77.19, 73.64, 70.99, 70.79, 69.83, 68.46, 65.80, 62.73,
56.85, 54.68, 51.32, 50.52, 49.53, 45.99, 44.18, 35.88, 34.93, 32.15,
32.02, 29.97, 29.51, 29.44, 27.48, 25.92, 24.73, 23.59, 22.97, 20.83,
19.67, 18.24, -1.26 ppm; HRMS calcd for C57H82O12SiNa+ [M + Na+]
1009.5467 found 1009.5471.
