$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Aldehyde carbonate (-)-97: To a stirred solution of hydroxyl carbonate
(-)-25-2 (1.22 g, 1.23 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (20 mL) at 25°C were added
PhI(OAc)2 (5.0 equiv, 1.98 g, 6.15 mmol) and TEMPO (1.0 equiv, 0.19 mg,
1.23 mmol). The resulting mixture was stirred at ambient temperature for
24 h and then quenched with saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution (10 mL).
The resulting mixture was extracted with Et2O (2 × 20 mL), dried (MgSO4),
and concentrated in vacuo. The crude residue was purified by flash column
chromatography (silica, Et2O/hexanes, 10 → 40%) to furnish aldehyde
carbonate (-)-97 (175 mg, 0.178 mmol, 98%) as a white foam. compound
(-)-97, yield (175 mg, 0.178 mmol, 98%) Rf = 0.70 (silica, Et2O:hexanes,
1:1); [α]25 D = -18.2 (c = 2.0, CHCl3); IR (film): νmax = 2952s, 2875s,
1742s, 1716m, 1647w, 1378m, 1266m, 1039s cm-1; 1H NMR (C6D6, 500 MHz): δ
= 10.01 (s, 1 H), 7.37 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H), 7.32 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1 H),
7.17 - 7.15 (m, 4 H), 7.08 (m, 1 H), 6.30 (s, 1 H), 6.07 (s, 1 H), 4.96
(s, 1 H), 4.89 (s, 1 H), 4.80 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.78 (d, J = 7.5 Hz,
1 H), 4.71 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.68 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.67 (s, 2
H), 4.63 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.62 - 4.60 (m, 2 H), 4.57 (d, J = 12.0
Hz, 1 H), 4.52 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.42 (d, J = 11.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.27 (d,
J = 1.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.21 (t, J = 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 3.93 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1 H),
3.71 (m, 2 H), 3.43 (s, 3 H), 3.10 (t, J = 8.5 Hz, 1 H), 2.67 (m, 1 H),
2.53 (m, 1 H), 2.38 - 2.33 (m, 3 H), 2.31 (d, J = 2.5 Hz, 1 H), 2.26 (m,
3 H), 2.20 - 1.85 (m, 9 H), 1.79 (s, 3 H), 1.79 - 1.71 (m, 5 H), 1.40 (s,
3 H), 1.31 (s, 3 H), 1.29 (s, 3 H), 1.19 (s, 3 H), 0.97 (t, J = 8.5 Hz, 1
Hz), 0.00 (s, 9 H) ppm; 13C NMR (C6D6, 125 MHz): δ = 201.53, 156.15,
144.45, 144.33, 139.01, 138.62, 133.26, 127.71, 127.55, 111.79, 99.22,
95.18, 95.01, 89.35, 82.99, 79.75, 77.35, 76.67, 75.45, 70.10, 70.03,
67.0, 65.89, 64.97, 63.09, 54.76, 53.26, 52.56, 52.14, 48.98, 46.60,
38.35, 30.72, 26.50, 26.04, 25.69, 25.20, 24.51, 24.08, 23.76, 22.60,
21.03, 18.40, -1.26 ppm; HRMS calcd for C57H82O12SiNa+ [M + Na+]
1009.5467 found 1009.5442.
