$DATUM Aldehyde carbonate (+)-100: To a stirred solution of hydroxy carbonate
(+)-98 (620 mg, 0.513 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (10 mL) at 25 °C were added
PhI(OAc)2 (3.0 equiv, 0.49 g, 1.53 mmol) and AZADO (0.1 equiv, 8 mg,
0.051 mmol). The resulting mixture was stirred at that temperature for 24
h and then quenched with saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution (10 mL). The
mixture was extracted with Et2O (2 x 20 mL), dried (MgSO4), and
concentrated under reduced pressure. The crude residue was purified by
flash column chromatography (silica, EtOAc/hexanes, 5 - 20%) as a white
foam, yield 600 mg, 0.497 mmol, 97%. Rf = 0.60 (silica, Et2O:hexanes,
1:1); [α]25D = +6.87 (c = 4.0, CHCl3); IR (film): νmax = 2951s, 2891s,
1751s, 1710m, 1440w, 1379m, 1263s, 1027s cm-1; 1H NMR (C6D6, 500 MHz): δ
= 10.21 (s, 1 H), 7.36 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 2 H), 7.32 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 2 H),
7.22 (m, 4 H), 7.09 (m, 2 H), 6.41 (s, 1 H), 6.01 (s, 1 H), 5.13 (d, J =
6.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.98 (d, J = 6.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.93 (s, 1 H), 4.87 (s, 1 H),
4.78 (s, 2 H), 4.70 - 4.67 (m, 4 H), 4.65 (s, 1 H), 4.60 (d, J = 12.0 Hz,
1 H), 4.59 (d, J = 6.5 Hz, 1 H), 4.55 - 4.51 (m, 4 H), 4.48 (d, J = 8.0
Hz, 1 H), 4.46 (d, J = 11.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.44 (s, 1 H), 4.25 (d, J = 11.0
Hz, 1 H), 4.17 (t, J = 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 3.76 - 3.65 (m, 5 H), 3.50 (s, 3 H),
3.29 (m, 1 H), 3.06 (t, J = 8.5 Hz, 1 H), 2.77 (t, J = 11.0 Hz, 1 H),
2.69 (d, J = 4.0 Hz, 1 H), 2.55 - 2.35 (m, 3 H), 2.35 - 2.20 (m, 4 H),
2.14 - 2.10 (m, 5 H), 2.00 (m, 1 H), 1.92 - 1.88 (m, 2 H), 1.77 (s, 3 H),
1.76 - 1.65 (m, 3 H), 1.29 (m, 1 H), 1.25 (s, 3 H), 1.22 (s, 3 H), 0.98
(m, 6 H), 0.06 (s, 9 H), 0.01 (s, 9 H), -0.01 (s, 9 H) ppm; 13C NMR
(C6D6, 125 MHz): δ = 202.20, 155.74, 144.58, 144.35, 139.07, 138.60,
133.25, 127.70, 127.49, 111.64, 96.89, 95.30, 95.02, 93.93, 89.64, 89.27,
82.97, 80.82, 78.23, 77.08, 70.37, 69.96, 67.68, 66.48, 66.31, 65.08,
63.78, 60.52, 59.22, 54.71, 53.09, 52.11, 48.76, 46.07, 39.40, 30.73,
30.54, 27.68, 27.12, 26.37, 25.94, 24.08, 23.74, 22.93, 20.16, 18.44,
17.82, -1.18, -1.23, -1.33 ppm; HRMS calcd for C66H106O14Si3Na+ [M + Na+]
1229.6782 found 1229.6785.
