$DATUM Aldehyde carbonate (-)-22: To a stirred solution of hydroxy carbonate
(-)-20-1 (350 mg, 0.35 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (15 mL) at 25 °C were added
PhI(OAc)2 (2.0 equiv, 0.29 g, 0.71 mmol) and TEMPO (1.0 equiv, 0.055 g,
0.35 mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred for 24 h and then quenched
with saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution (10 mL). The resulting mixture was
extracted with Et2O (2 x 20 mL), dried (MgSO4), and concentrated in
vacuo. The crude residue was purified by flash column chromatography
(Et2O/hexanes, 5 - 20%) to furnish aldehyde carbonate (-)-22 as a pale
yellow oil, yield 340 mg, 0.344 mmol, 97%. Rf = 0.45 (silica,
Et2O:hexanes, 4:6); [α]25D = -24.17 (c = 4.8, CHCl3); IR (film): νmax =
2952s, 2891s, 1742s, 1716m, 1496w, 1441m, 1337m, 1265s, 1027s cm-1; 1H
NMR (C6D6, 600 MHz): δ = 10.02 (s, 1 H), 7.38 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 2 H), 7.33
(d, J = 7.2 Hz, 2 H), 7.19 - 7.16 (m, 4 H), 7.09 - 7.06 (m, 2 H), 6.43
(s, 1 H), 6.19 (s, 1 H), 4.97 (s, 1 H), 4.90 (s, 1 H), 4.73 (d, J = 7.2
Hz, 1 H), 4.71 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.66 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.65 (s,
2 H), 4.63 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.62 - 4.54 (m, 4 H), 4.47 (d, J = 7.8
Hz, 2 H), 4.32 (s, 1 H), 4.25 (s, 1 H), 4.01 (d, J = 10.8 Hz, 1 H), 3.77
(dd, J = 16.8, 7.8 Hz, 1 H), 3.54 (dd, J = 16.8, 7.8 Hz, 1 H), 3.43 (s, 3
H), 3.15 (t, J = 8.4 Hz, 1 H), 2.82 (ddd, J = 9.6, 9.0, 4.8 Hz, 1 H),
2.58 (dt, J = 12.6, 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 2.51 (d, J = 3.6 Hz, 1 H), 2.44 (m, 1
H), 2.37 - 2.15 (m, 7 H), 2.03 (m, 3 H), 1.98 - 1.84 (m, 3 H), 1.80 (s, 3
H), 1.74 (m, 3 H), 1.33 (s, 3 H), 1.25 (s, 3 H), 1.22 (s, 3 H), 1.09 (s,
3 H), 0.94 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 0.06 (s, 9 H) ppm; 13C NMR (C6D6, 150
MHz): δ = 202.04, 156.18, 144.77, 14.43, 138.99, 138.59, 132.44, 128.57,
128.53, 128.50, 111.75, 99.03, 95.32, 94.96, 89.69, 82.89, 78.99, 76.93,
76.37, 70.33, 70.03, 67.10, 66.02, 65.19, 62.90, 57.06, 54.79, 54.25,
52.17, 50.50, 49.03, 46.76, 36.14, 30.90, 30.53, 26.59, 25.96, 25.83,
25.79, 25.73, 24.80, 24.71, 23.80, 22.77, 21.29, 18.26, -1.12 ppm; HRMS
calcd for C57H82O12SiNa+ [M + Na+] 1009.5467 found 1009.5457.
