$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Aldehyde 39. 200 μL of a solution of TEMPO (13.2 mg, 84.6 μmol) and BAIB
(136 mg, 0.423 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (600 μL) was added to a solution of
alcohol 22 (49.7 mg, 0.141 mmol) in CH2Cl2/pH 7 Buffer (4:1, 4.25 mL).
Two extra additions of the above TEMPO/BAIB solution (100 μL and 150 μL)
were added (after 2 h and 2 h 40 min respectively) and the reaction
mixture was allowed to stir for 3 h at rt. The reaction mixture was
quenched with sat. aq. NaHCO3 (2 mL) and sat. aq. Na2S2O3 (2 mL), and the
mixture was stirred for 40 min before the phases were separated. The
aqueous phase was extracted with CH2Cl2 (2 x 5 mL), EtOAc (2 x 5 mL), the
combined organic extracts were then dried (Na2SO4), filtered,
concentrated in vacuo and purified by flash column chromatography
(gradient elution: EtOAc/40-60 PE, 1:5 - 1:2). Aldehyde 39 as a colorless
oil, yield 47.5 mg, 0.136 mmol, 96%. Rf 0.43 (EtOAc/40-60 PE, 1:1);
[α]20D = -26.8 (c 1.0, CHCl3); IR (thin film, νmax): 3445, 2962, 2927,
2871, 1709, 1495, 1456, 1374, 1325, 1249, 1148, 1115, 1085, 1054, 1019,
974, 808 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3): δ 9.64 (d, 1H, J9,10 = 1.7 Hz,
H-10), 7.27 (d, 2H, Ja,b = 8.1 Hz, CH arom. STol), 7.22 (d, 2H, Ja,b =
8.1 Hz, CH arom. STol), 3.89-3.83 (m, 1H, H-3), 3.38 (td, 1H, J4b,5 =
J5,6 = 10.5, J4a,5 = 4.7 Hz, H-5), 3.05 (td, 1H, J6,7 = J7,8a = 10.2,
J7,8b = 2.4 Hz, H-7), 2.89 (dd, 1H, J2a,2b = 14.9, J2a,3 = 8.2 Hz, H-2a),
2.68 (dd, 1H, J2a,2b = 14.9, J2b,3 = 4.7 Hz, H-2b), 2.68-2.60 (m, 1H,
H-9), 2.37 (s, 3H, CH3 STol), 2.02 (ddd, 1H, J4a,4b = 12.3, J4a,5 = 4.7,
J3,4a = 1.9 Hz, H-4a), 1.85 (ddd, 1H, J8a,8b = 14.1, J7,8a = 10.5, J8a,9
= 5.7 Hz, H-8a), 1.60 (ddd, 1H, J8a,8b = 14.1, J8b,9 = 8.3, J7,8b = 2.4
Hz, H-8b), 1.36 (app q, 1H, J3,4a = J4a,4b = J4b,5 = 11.4 Hz, H-4b),
1.29-1.21 (m, 1H, H-6), 1.07 (d, 3H, J9,29 = 7.1 Hz, CH3 H-29), 0.98 (d,
3H, J6,28 = 6.5 Hz, CH3 H-28); 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3): δ 205.3, 195.6,
139.9, 134.5, 130.2, 124.1, 78.7, 73.2, 72.4, 49.5, 44.3, 43.6, 40.6,
34.3, 21.5, 13.5, 12.9; HRMS (ES+) m/z calc. for [C19H26O4S+NH4]+:
368.1890, obsd.: 368.1895.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
