$DATUM (1'S,5R)-5-{1'-[(tert-Butyldimethylsilyl)oxy]-2'-oxoethyl}-3H,5H-furan-2-one
(19). To a soln of alcohol 18 (215 mg, 0.729 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (10 mL) were
added bis(acetoxy)iodobenzene (BAIB) (270 mg, 0.838 mmol) and a catalytic
amount of 4-hydroxy-2,2,6,6-tetramethylpiperidine1-oxyl (4-hydroxyTEMPO).
The resulting mixture was stirred at r.t. for 24 h. After this time, the
solvent was removed and the residue dissolved in MTBE (50 mL). The
resulting soln was washed with 15% aq Na2S2O3 soln (3 × 30 mL) and sat.
aq NaHCO3 soln (3 × 30 mL). The organic phase was dried and the solvent
evaporated under reduced pressure to give a brown residue, which was
chromatographed on silica gel (30% EtOAc-hexane) to afford aldehyde.
Yield: 182 mg (96%); colorless crystals. mp 60-61 °C; Rf = 0.28 (30%
EtOAc-hexane); [α]D25 -90.0 (c 1, CHCl3). IR (NaCl): 2938, 1703, 1402,
1040 cm-1. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 9.66 (s, 1 H, OCH), 4.85 (m, 1 H,
H-1'), 4.01 (m, 1 H, H-5), 2.56 (m, 2 H, H-3), 2.36 (m, 1 H, H-4), 2.18
(m, 1 H, H-4), 0.94 (s, 9 H, CH3-t-Bu), 0.12 (s, 6 H, CH3-Si). 13C NMR
(100 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 202.1 (C═O), 176.5 (C═O), 79.8 (CH-1'), 79.4
(CH-5), 27.8 (CH2-3), 25.7 (CH3-t-Bu), 23.3 (CH2-4), 18.1 (C-t-Bu), -4.6
(CH3-Si), -5.1 (CH3-Si). MS (ESI): m/z (%) = 281 (10) [M + Na]+, 260 (6)
[M + 2]+, 259 (37) [M + 1]+, 158 (100). HRMS (ESI): m/z [M + 1]+ calcd
for C12H23O4Si: 259.1360; found: 259.1369.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of (-)-muricatacin from tri-O-acetyl-D-glucal
