$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ketone (+)-23. To a solution of ether (+)-SI7 (607 mg, 1.57 mmol) in
CH2Cl2 (1.6 mL) were added AZADO (71.6 mg, 0.47mmol) and PhI(OAc)2(760
mg, 2.36 mmol) and the mixture was stirred for 3 h at room temperature.
The reactionmixture was quenched with saturated aqueous Na2SO3 and
extracted with Et2O. The combined organic layers werewashed with brine,
dried over MgSO4 and concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was
purified by silicagel column chromatography (EtOAc / Hexane = 1 / 8) to
give ketone (+)-23 as a white solid, yield 581 mg, 96%. [α]D27 +142.3 (c
= 0.58, CHCl3); IR (neat): 2952, 2881, 2854, 1736 cm-1; 1H-NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3): δ4.13 (dd,J = 10.8, 4.8 Hz, 1H), 4.01-3.91 (m, 3H), 3.88 (dd, J =
10.8, 1.6 Hz, 1H), 3.77 (q, J = 6.4 Hz, 1H), 2.52 (br d, J =11.6 Hz, 1H),
2.33-2.27 (m, 2H), 1.96-1.59 (m, 6H), 1.54 (d, J = 5.2 Hz, 1H), 1.48
(ddd, J = 12.2, 7.2, 2.4 Hz, 1H),1.32-1.24 (m, 1H), 0.92 (s, 3H), 0.87
(s, 9H), 0.06 (s, 3H), 0.03 (s, 3H); 13C-NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3):
δ217.0,111.5, 65.0, 64.7, 58.1, 52.9, 50.4, 45.4, 44.3, 38.1, 35.3, 28.8,
25.9, 25.2, 24.2, 24.0, 18.3, -5.7, -6.0; HRMS (EI):calcd for C17H27O4Si
(M+-tBu): 323.1679, found 323.1679.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
