$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Aldehyde carbonate (-)-30: To a stirred solution of hydroxy carbonate
(-)-28-1 (102 mg, 0.103 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (1.0 mL) at 25 °C were added
PhI(OAc)2 (2.0 equiv, 0.1 g, 0.31 mmol) and AZADO (0.10 equiv, 32 mg,
0.021 mmol). The resulting mixture was stirred for 24 h and then quenched
with a mixture of saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution (5 mL) and saturated
aqueous Na2S2O3 (5 mL). The resulting mixture was extracted with Et2O (2
x 15 mL), dried (MgSO4), and concentrated in vacuo. The crude residue was
purified by flash column chromatography (silica, EtOAc/hexanes, 2 - 10%)
to furnish aldehyde carbonate (-)-30 as a white foam, yield 97 mg, 0.098
mmol, 95%. Rf = 0.6 (silica, EtOAc:hexanes, 1:4); [α]25D = -76.8 (c =
1.1, CHCl3); IR (film): νmax = 2951s, 2891s, 1749s, 1721s, 1441w, 1379m,
1267m, 1036s cm-1; 1H NMR (C6D6, 600 MHz): δ = 9.91 (s, 1 H), 7.43 (d, J
= 7.2 Hz, 2 H), 7.36 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 2 H), 7.21 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 2 H),
7.16 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 2 H), 7.11 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.06 (t, J = 7.2
Hz, 1 H), 6.00 (s, 1 H), 5.68 (s, 1 H), 4.98 (s, 1 H), 4.94 (s, 2 H),
4.92 (s, 1 H), 4.90 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.84 (s, 1 H), 4.80 (d, J =
12.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.79 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.74 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.68
(s, 1 H), 4.67 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.64 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 4.62 (d,
J = 12.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.52 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.47 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1
H), 4.41 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.28 (d, J = 12.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.27 (dd, J =
12.0, 2.4 Hz, 1 H), 4.22 (t, J = 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.01 (m, 1 H), 3.88 - 3.84
(m, 2 H), 3.75 - 3.66 (m, 3 H), 3.41 (m, 1 H), 3.33 (s, 3 H), 2.85 (d, J
= 3.6 Hz, 1 H), 2.84 (m, 1 H), 2.70 - 2.65 (m, 2 H), 2.56 (m, 1 H), 2.36
- 2.16 (m, 4 H), 2.15 - 1.96 (m, 7 H), 1.88 - 1.86 (m, 2 H), 1.76 (s, 3
H), 1.75 - 1.74 (m, 2 H), 1.69 (s, 3 H), 1.13 (s, 3 H), 1.09 - 1.02 (m, 6
H), 0.09 (s, 9 H), 0.08 (s, 9 H), 0.06 (s, 9 H) ppm; 13C NMR (C6D6, 150
MHz): δ = 199.33, 155.35, 148.87, 144.45, 139.18, 138.64, 127.53, 124.77,
111.81, 96.88, 96.06, 95.05, 94.16, 90.13, 84.43, 83.25, 83.00, 78.05,
76.45, 71.12, 69.89, 68.63, 66.56, 65.98, 65.70, 65.00, 61.73, 59.13,
57.24, 54.59, 51.20, 49.46, 47.47, 46.55, 37.85, 31.55, 29.34, 28.36,
27.84, 26.13, 25.02, 23.70, 23.43, 19.61, 18.59, 18.52, 18.15, -1.12,
-1.23, -1.25 ppm; HRMS calcd for C66H106O14Si3Na+ [M + Na+] 1229.6782.
found 1229.6764.
