$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A mixture of tosylate xi (432 mg, 0.701 mmol) and IBX (400 mg, 1.43 mmol)
in DMSO (5.5 mL) was stirred for 2.5 h at room temperature, and the
reaction was stopped by adding isopropyl alcohol (1.2 mL). After adding
saturated aqueous NaHCO3, the mixture was filtered through a Celite pad.
The products were extracted with Et2O (x3), and the combined organic
extracts were washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4 and concentrated in
vacuo. The residue was purified by flash column chromatography
(hexane/EtOAc = 2/8→ 1/9) to afford ketone xii,which was reprecipitated
from hexane/EtOAc as powders. Cream-colored powders, yield 401 mg, 93%.
Mp 63.8-65.0 °C. [α]D24-12 (c 1.0, CHCl3). Rf 0.72 (CHCl3/MeOH = 9/1). 1H
NMR(δ, CDCl3) 1.35 (s, 9H), 2.13 (dt, 1H, J1 =17.3, J2 = 7.0 Hz),
2.38-2.56 (m, 4H), 3.64 (s, 3H), 3.78 (s, 3H), 3.90-4.09 (m, 5H), 4.09
(d, 1H, J = 18.6 Hz), 4.67 (d, 1H, J = 18.6 Hz), 5.83 (s, 1H), 6.21 (s,
1H), 6.45 (s, 1H), 7.33 (d, 2H, J = 8.5 Hz), 7.49 (s, 1H), 7.68 (d, 2H, J
= 8.5 Hz). 13C NMR(δ, CDCl3) 21.3, 27.6, 27.7, 30.0, 49.5, 55.0, 55.9,
63.2, 65.9, 82.6, 107.3, 107.9, 114.6, 123.2, 124.7, 127.5, 129.7, 132.1,
132.8, 144.9, 149.3, 150.0, 153.7, 154.7, 160.9, 180.4, 188.6. IR (ATR)
3010, 2979, 2938, 1671, 1646, 1621, 1600, 1512, 1364, 1286, 1219, 1172,
1051, 972 cm-1. Anal. Calcd for C31H35NO10S: C, 60.67; H, 5.75; N, 2.28;
S, 5.23. Found: C, 60.45; H, 6.05; N, 2.26; S, 5.06.
