$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a solution of 18 (173 mg, 0.32 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (20 mL) were added
2,2,6,6-tetramethylpiperidinooxy (51 mg, 0.32 mmol) and phenyliodine
diacetate (155 mg, 0.48 mmol) at room temperature. The mixture was
stirred at room temperature until TLC indicated disappearance of the
starting material (~4 h). The mixture was quenched by saturated Na2S2O3
solution, diluted with CH2Cl2 and washed with brine. The aqueous layer
was extracted with CH2Cl2 twice. The combined organic layer was dried
over Na2SO4 and concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by silica
gel column chromatography (CH2Cl2/MeOH, 100:1 to 50:1 to 30:1). Compound
3 as a white solid (157 mg, 91%) (sample for X-ray diffraction analysis
was obtained via vapor diffusion in CH2Cl2/iPr2O at 0 °C). [α]D 27 = 26.6
(c 1.2, CHCl3); 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 9.52 (d, J = 1.7 Hz, 1H), 5.38
(dd, J = 11.2, 2.7 Hz, 1H), 5.27 (dd, J = 8.2, 2.7 Hz, 1H), 4.65 (s, 2H),
4.02-3.93 (m, 1H), 3.56 (s, 1H), 3.42 (br s, 1H), 3.35 (s, 3H), 3.31 (br
s, 1H), 2.81-2.73 (m, 1H), 2.19 (dd, J = 12.8, 11.7 Hz, 1H), 2.12 (dd, J
= 14.4, 3.2 Hz, 2H), 2.03 (s, 3H), 1.98 (s, 3H), 1.30 (s, 3H), 1.19 (s,
3H), 1.12 (d, J = 7.3 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3) δ 202.8, 170.8,
169.8, 94.9, 79.3, 78.1, 76.8, 75.5, 75.0, 73.3, 59.4, 55.2, 52.6, 47.3,
44.0, 43.3, 40.9, 38.5, 38.1, 33.1, 27.2, 21.5, 20.9, 18.2, 17.3, 16.3,
12.8; ESI-HRMS calcd for C28H48NO10 [M+NH4]+ 558.3273, found 558.3270.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Total Synthesis of Linckosides A and B, the Representative Starfish
Polyhydroxysteroid Glycosides with Neuritogenic Activities
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Zhu, Dapeng; Yu, Biao
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2015), 137(48), 15098-15101

